#: title/pc5_ui.c:7494 title/pc5_ui.c:9176 title/pc5_ui.c:9204
msgid "Uninstall"
msgstr "Avinstallera"

#: title/pc5_ui.c:7495
msgid "Deletes the game, or keeps its saves for later"
msgstr "Tar bort spelet, eller behåller sparfilerna till senare"

#: title/pc5_ui.c:7508
msgid "What the game sees when you play with the controller."
msgstr "Vad spelet ser när du spelar med handkontrollen."

#: title/pc5_ui.c:7509
msgid "Xbox controller: what most PC games expect. Try this first."
msgstr ""
"Xbox-handkontroll: det de flesta PC-spel förväntar sig. Prova den först."

#: title/pc5_ui.c:7510
msgid ""
"DualSense: a PS5 controller plugged into a PC, with PlayStation buttons in "
"games that support it."
msgstr ""
"DualSense: en PS5-handkontroll ansluten till en PC, med "
"PlayStation-knappar i spel som stöder det."

#: title/pc5_ui.c:7511
msgid ""
"Keyboard & mouse: for games with no controller support. The buttons press "
"keys and the sticks move the mouse; Button mapping changes which key each "
"one sends."
msgstr ""
"Tangentbord och mus: för spel utan stöd för handkontroll. Knapparna "
"trycker på tangenter och spakarna flyttar musen; i Knappmappning väljer du "
"vilken tangent varje knapp skickar."

#: title/pc5_ui.c:7514
msgid ""
"What each button, stick and the touchpad sends to the game with Keyboard & "
"mouse."
msgstr ""
"Vad varje knapp, varje spak och styrplattan skickar till spelet med "
"Tangentbord och mus."

#: title/pc5_ui.c:7515
msgid ""
"Touchpad: One button (a click sends one key), Halves and swipes (a key for "
"each half's click and each quick swipe up, down, left or right), or Mouse "
"(a finger moves the pointer, like a laptop's)."
msgstr ""
"Styrplatta: En knapp (ett klick skickar en tangent), Halvor och svep (en "
"tangent för klick på varje halva och för varje snabbt svep uppåt, nedåt, "
"åt vänster eller åt höger) eller Mus (ett finger flyttar pekaren, som på "
"en bärbar dator)."

#: title/pc5_ui.c:7516
msgid "Two-finger click: PC5's on-screen keyboard, or a key of its own."
msgstr "Klick med två fingrar: PC5:s skärmtangentbord eller en egen tangent."

#: title/pc5_ui.c:7517
msgid "Save as my mapping keeps your layout for every game set up after it."
msgstr ""
"Spara som min mappning behåller din layout för varje spel som ställs in "
"efteråt."

#: title/pc5_ui.c:7520
msgid "Whether the game sees the Create button."
msgstr ""

#: title/pc5_ui.c:7521
msgid ""
"Sent: the game sees it, as Back (Select) on an Xbox controller or as "
"Create on a DualSense."
msgstr ""

#: title/pc5_ui.c:7522
msgid ""
"Not sent: the game never sees it, so taking a screenshot with the PS5's "
"Create button doesn't press anything in the game."
msgstr ""

#: title/pc5_ui.c:7525
msgid "Whether the mouse pointer shows over the game."
msgstr "Om muspekaren visas över spelet."

#: title/pc5_ui.c:7526
msgid "Normal: the game decides, as on a PC."
msgstr "Normal: spelet bestämmer, som på en PC."

#: title/pc5_ui.c:7527
msgid ""
"Auto-hide: hidden after 5 seconds without moving or clicking, for a game "
"that leaves it on the screen."
msgstr ""
"Dölj automatiskt: döljs efter 5 sekunder utan att flyttas eller klickas, "
"för ett spel som lämnar den kvar på skärmen."

#: title/pc5_ui.c:7530
msgid ""
"How the game's pictures are made on the console. Auto is right for almost "
"every game; the others are for a game that won't start or shows a wrong "
"picture."
msgstr ""
"Hur spelets bilder skapas på konsolen. Auto passar nästan alla spel; de "
"andra är för ett spel som inte startar eller visar fel bild."

#: title/pc5_ui.c:7532
msgid ""
"Alternative: another way to draw the game. Try it if the picture is wrong "
"with Auto."
msgstr ""
"Alternativ: ett annat sätt att rita spelet. Prova det om bilden blir fel "
"med Auto."

#: title/pc5_ui.c:7533
msgid ""
"2D only: for a 2D game that flickers or shows only part of its screen."
msgstr ""
"Bara 2D: för ett 2D-spel som flimrar eller bara visar en del av sin skärm."

#: title/pc5_ui.c:7535
msgid ""
"Alternative: slower than Auto. Try it if the game won't start or its "
"picture is wrong."
msgstr ""
"Alternativ: långsammare än Auto. Prova det om spelet inte startar eller "
"bilden blir fel."

#: title/pc5_ui.c:7537
msgid ""
"Auto: OpenGL is ready for the game in case it asks for it while it runs."
msgstr ""

#: title/pc5_ui.c:7538
msgid ""
"Windows only: without OpenGL. Try it if the game starts or draws worse "
"with Auto."
msgstr ""

#: title/pc5_ui.c:7540
msgid ""
"Alternative: another way to draw the game. Try it if the picture is wrong "
"with Auto. Some mods need it."
msgstr ""
"Alternativ: ett annat sätt att rita spelet. Prova det om bilden blir fel "
"med Auto. Vissa moddar behöver det."

#: title/pc5_ui.c:7541
msgid "Compatibility (slow): the slowest, but it starts the most games."
msgstr "Kompatibel (långsam): långsammast, men startar flest spel."

#: title/pc5_ui.c:7543
msgid "Choose the row to see each one with what it does."
msgstr "Välj raden för att se varje alternativ och vad det gör."

#: title/pc5_ui.c:7546
msgid ""
"Makes extra frames between the game's own, so movement looks smoother. It "
"can add a little delay to the controls."
msgstr ""
"Skapar extra bilder mellan spelets egna, så att rörelser ser jämnare ut. "
"Det kan göra styrningen lite fördröjd."

#: title/pc5_ui.c:7547
msgid "30 → 60 fps: the game is held at 30 fps and shown at 60."
msgstr "30 → 60 fps: spelet låses till 30 fps och visas i 60."

#: title/pc5_ui.c:7548
msgid ""
"60 → 120 fps: held at 60 and shown at 120, on a 120 Hz TV with 120 Hz "
"output on in Settings."
msgstr ""
"60 → 120 fps: låst till 60 och visas i 120, på en 120 Hz-tv med 120 "
"Hz-utgång på i Inställningar."

#: title/pc5_ui.c:7549
msgid ""
"40 → 120 fps: held at 40, two frames made between each two, for a game "
"that can't hold 60."
msgstr ""
"40 → 120 fps: låst till 40, två bilder skapas mellan varje två, för ett "
"spel som inte klarar 60."

#: title/pc5_ui.c:7552
msgid ""
"The size the game is drawn at. The console always shows 4K, so a smaller "
"picture is scaled up."
msgstr ""
"Storleken spelet ritas i. Konsolen visar alltid 4K, så en mindre bild "
"skalas upp."

#: title/pc5_ui.c:7553
msgid "1080p: the fastest, and right for most games."
msgstr "1080p: snabbast, och rätt för de flesta spel."

#: title/pc5_ui.c:7554
msgid "1440p: sharper, but slower."
msgstr "1440p: skarpare, men långsammare."

#: title/pc5_ui.c:7555
msgid ""
"4K: the sharpest, four times the work of 1080p: only for light games."
msgstr ""
"4K: skarpast, fyra gånger så mycket arbete som 1080p: bara för lätta spel."

#: title/pc5_ui.c:7558
msgid "The shape of the picture on the TV."
msgstr "Bildens form på tv:n."

#: title/pc5_ui.c:7559
msgid ""
"Keep: the picture's own shape. An older 4:3 game gets black bars at the "
"sides."
msgstr ""
"Behåll: bildens egen form. Ett äldre 4:3-spel får svarta kanter på sidorna."

#: title/pc5_ui.c:7560
msgid "Stretch: fills the whole screen, so a 4:3 picture gets wider."
msgstr "Sträck ut: fyller hela skärmen, så en 4:3-bild blir bredare."

#: title/pc5_ui.c:7563
msgid "How much memory an older 32-bit game may use."
msgstr "Hur mycket minne ett äldre 32-bitarsspel får använda."

#: title/pc5_ui.c:7564
msgid "Auto: as on Windows, 4 GB for a game made for it, otherwise 2 GB."
msgstr ""
"Auto: som i Windows, 4 GB för ett spel som är gjort för det, annars 2 GB."

#: title/pc5_ui.c:7565
msgid ""
"4 GB: for a game that runs out of memory, often with big mods. Set it back "
"to Auto if the game misbehaves."
msgstr ""
"4 GB: för ett spel som får slut på minne, ofta med stora moddar. Sätt "
"tillbaka till Auto om spelet strular."

#: title/pc5_ui.c:7568
msgid ""
"How much graphics memory the game is told the console has. The PS5's "
"memory is shared by the game and its graphics, so more for graphics leaves "
"less for the game."
msgstr ""
"Hur mycket grafikminne spelet får veta att konsolen har. PS5:ans minne "
"delas av spelet och dess grafik, så mer till grafiken lämnar mindre åt "
"spelet."

#: title/pc5_ui.c:7570
msgid ""
"512 MB or 1 GB: less for textures, more for the game, for one that runs "
"out of memory."
msgstr ""
"512 MB eller 1 GB: mindre för texturer, mer för spelet, om minnet tar slut."

#: title/pc5_ui.c:7571
msgid ""
"Auto: 2 GB at most, so older games don't get confused by a large number."
msgstr ""
"Auto: högst 2 GB, så att äldre spel inte blir förvirrade av ett stort tal."

#: title/pc5_ui.c:7572
msgid ""
"3 GB or Maximum: for a game that says there is too little. Set it back to "
"Auto if it misbehaves."
msgstr ""
"3 GB eller Max: för ett spel som ser för lite. Välj Auto igen om det "
"strular."

#: title/pc5_ui.c:7574
msgid ""
"2 GB or 3 GB: less for textures, more for the game, for one that runs out "
"of memory."
msgstr ""
"2 GB eller 3 GB: mindre för texturer, mer för spelet, om minnet tar slut."

#: title/pc5_ui.c:7575
msgid "Auto: 4 GB, room for both."
msgstr "Auto: 4 GB, plats för båda."

#: title/pc5_ui.c:7576
msgid ""
"5 GB or 6 GB: more for textures. Set it back to Auto if the game runs out "
"of memory."
msgstr ""
"5 GB eller 6 GB: mer för texturer. Sätt tillbaka till Auto om spelet får "
"slut på minne."

#: title/pc5_ui.c:7577
msgid ""
"Maximum: all of it, only for a game that won't start because it sees too "
"little."
msgstr ""
"Max: allt, bara för ett spel som inte startar för att det ser för lite."

#: title/pc5_ui.c:7581
msgid "How many speakers the game is told the console has."
msgstr "Hur många högtalare spelet tror att konsolen har."

#: title/pc5_ui.c:7582
msgid "Stereo: two, right for a TV or headphones."
msgstr "Stereo: två, för tv eller hörlurar."

#: title/pc5_ui.c:7583
msgid ""
"5.1 or 7.1: the game plays each sound on its own speaker of a surround "
"system, and the PS5 sends it on as it does its own games' sound."
msgstr ""
"5.1 eller 7.1: spelet spelar varje ljud i sin egen högtalare i ett "
"surroundsystem, och PS5 skickar det vidare som ljudet från sina egna spel."

#: title/pc5_ui.c:7584
msgid ""
"If the game is silent or plays only from the front, set it back to Stereo."
msgstr "Om spelet är tyst eller bara hörs framifrån, välj Stereo igen."

#: title/pc5_ui.c:7587
msgid ""
"Changes how the game's work is shared out on the console's processor."
msgstr "Ändrar hur spelets arbete fördelas på konsolens processor."

#: title/pc5_ui.c:7588
msgid "Off: the fastest for most games."
msgstr "Av: snabbast för de flesta spel."

#: title/pc5_ui.c:7589
msgid ""
"On: the game's work takes turns, as on a PC. Try it if the game freezes, "
"stutters or hangs while loading; it can be a little slower."
msgstr ""
"På: spelets arbete turas om, som på en PC. Prova det om spelet fryser, "
"hackar eller hänger sig vid laddning; det kan bli lite långsammare."

#: title/pc5_ui.c:7592
msgid ""
"Many PC games need Steam running to start. The console has no Steam, so "
"PC5 stands in for it."
msgstr ""
"Många PC-spel behöver Steam igång för att starta. Konsolen har inget "
"Steam, så PC5 ersätter det."

#: title/pc5_ui.c:7593
msgid "Auto: the game starts as if Steam were running, offline."
msgstr "Auto: spelet startar som om Steam vore igång, offline."

#: title/pc5_ui.c:7594
msgid ""
"Off: the game's own Steam files are used. It won't find Steam and may not "
"start; only for a game that misbehaves with Auto."
msgstr ""
"Av: spelets egna Steam-filer används. Det hittar inte Steam och startar "
"kanske inte; bara för ett spel som strular med Auto."

#: title/pc5_ui.c:7597
msgid ""
"A player who got this game running put their settings in the game "
"compatibility list (Report it works)."
msgstr ""

#: title/pc5_ui.c:7598
msgid ""
"Choose it to see what they changed, and use the same settings. The game's "
"other settings stay as they are."
msgstr ""

#: title/pc5_ui.c:7601
msgid ""
"Makes the game's Windows new, as a fresh install has it. Use it when a "
"game that used to work stops starting."
msgstr ""

#: title/pc5_ui.c:7602
msgid ""
"What stays: the game's files, its saves in its Windows user folders "
"(AppData, Documents, Saved Games) and PC5's settings for it."
msgstr ""

#: title/pc5_ui.c:7603
msgid ""
"What goes back to its default: the Windows settings the game kept in the "
"registry. Some games keep options or saves there; the old registry is kept "
"in the game's pc5/reset-backup folder."
msgstr ""

#: title/pc5_ui.c:7665
msgid "About"
msgstr "Info"

#: title/pc5_ui.c:7665 title/pc5_ui.c:8439
msgid "Receive from phone"
msgstr "Ta emot från telefon"

#: title/pc5_ui.c:7693
msgid "Touchpad + OPTIONS for 2 s still leaves the game"
msgstr "Styrplatta + OPTIONS i 2 s lämnar fortfarande spelet"

#: title/pc5_ui.c:7695
msgid "Two fingers: PC5's on-screen keyboard, or a key of its own"
msgstr "Två fingrar: PC5:s skärmtangentbord eller en egen tangent"

#: title/pc5_ui.c:7698
msgid "A key for each half's click and each quick swipe"
msgstr "En tangent för klick på varje halva och för varje snabbt svep"

#: title/pc5_ui.c:7699
msgid "A finger moves the pointer; a click sends its key"
msgstr "Ett finger flyttar pekaren; ett klick skickar sin tangent"

#: title/pc5_ui.c:7700
msgid "The whole touchpad is one button"
msgstr "Hela styrplattan är en knapp"

#: title/pc5_ui.c:7710
msgid "Right stick"
msgstr "Höger spak"

#: title/pc5_ui.c:7710
msgid "Left stick"
msgstr "Vänster spak"

#: title/pc5_ui.c:7718
msgid "Pointer speed"
msgstr "Pekarhastighet"

#. which picture is shown: 3 of 12.
